#: dist/linux/rustty_nautilus.py:53
msgid "Open in Rustty"
msgstr "Отвори в Rustty"

#: crates/rustty-apprt/assets/ui/1.0/clipboard-confirmation-dialog.blp:12
#: crates/rustty-apprt/assets/ui/1.4/clipboard-confirmation-dialog.blp:12
