#: crates/rustty-apprt/assets/ui/1.2/surface.blp:365 crates/rustty-apprt/assets/ui/1.5/window.blp:190
#: crates/rustty-apprt/assets/ui/1.5/window.blp:268 crates/rustty-input/src/command.rs:477
msgid "Split Left"
